==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*pero}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*(s)per-}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|πτερόν||wing, feather|tr=pteron|lang=grc}}, Lithuanian {{term|sparnas|lang=lt||aviation}}, and Old Armenian {{term|թիռ||tr=tʿiṙ|flight|lang=xcl}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-перо.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|[pʲɪˈro]|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|tr=peró|g=n|pl=перья|pltr=pérʹja|a=i}}

# [[feather]]
# [[plume]]
# [[pen]]
# {{context|criminal|_|slang|lang=ru}} [[knife]]

